{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47313","headline":"听尹链师弹琴 · 吴筠","name":"听尹链师弹琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至乐本太一，幽琴和乾坤。\n郑声久乱雅，此道稀能尊。\n吾见尹仙翁，伯牙今复存。\n衆人乘其流，夫子达其源。\n在山峻峰峙，在水洪涛奔。\n都忘迩城阙，但觉清心魂。\n代乏识微者，幽音谁与论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}